        "text_xtPwwF": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At AstroAura.market (operated by Stratnova Technologies LLC, India), we value your trust and aim to provide a transparent and smooth shopping experience. Since our products and services are highly personalized, spiritual, and energy-focused, we maintain a strict no cancellation and no refund policy once an order has been confirmed.</p><h3>1. Order Cancellations</h3><p><br/>Once an order is successfully placed and payment has been processed, it cannot be cancelled under any circumstances.<br/>This applies to both physical products (such as gemstones, crystals, and spiritual tools) and digital/consultation services (such as astrology reports or spiritual guidance).<br/>Orders placed in error must still be honored, as each product is sourced, energized, or prepared specifically for the customer.<br/></p><h3>2. Refund Policy</h3><p><br/>All sales are final. We do not offer refunds for any products or services once purchased.<br/>This policy exists because our items are often customized, spiritually charged, or uniquely prepared for individual needs, making them unsuitable for resale.<br/>Customers are advised to carefully review product details, service descriptions, and eligibility before placing an order.<br/></p><h3>3. Exceptional Circumstances</h3><p>While cancellations and refunds are generally not allowed, AstroAura.market may review special cases such as:<br/>Damaged or Defective Product: If the item arrives in damaged condition due to transit, customers may request a replacement in accordance with our Returns & Replacement Policy.<br/>Incorrect Order Fulfillment: In the rare case of receiving an incorrect product, customers are required to notify us immediately for resolution.<br/>Each such case will be handled on a case-by-case basis, and AstroAura.market reserves the sole right to approve or reject replacement requests.<br/></p><h3>4. Digital Services & Consultations</h3><p><br/>For astrology readings, reports, or spiritual consultations, once a booking or order has been confirmed, it cannot be cancelled or refunded.<br/>Rescheduling may be allowed in certain cases (subject to availability and discretion of our team), but refunds will not be processed.<br/></p><h3>5. Customer Responsibility</h3><p><br/>Customers are encouraged to review all product descriptions, sizes, specifications, and details carefully before purchase.<br/>For guidance, our support team is available to clarify product or service details before the order is placed.<br/></p><h3>6. Contact & Support</h3><p>For queries related to cancellations, refunds, or exceptional cases, please contact us:</p><p>📧 Email: vikram@astroaura.ai<br/> 📞 Phone: +91-9910602567</p><p>Our team will be happy to guide you and provide the necessary assistance in line with our policies.</p>"
